# React & UI

- Functional components only.
- Compose from `src/components/ui` (shadcn) before inventing new controls.
- Theme, radius, and color come from `src/index.css` CSS variables.
- UI files use kebab-case (`operator-card.tsx`, `chat-page.tsx`).
- Keep views thin; put orchestration in hooks/stores.
- GazeHero is a companion in the sidebar footer. No click handlers for
  navigation. Drive `state` from chat (`thinking` while sending).
- Chat stream shows tool actions live via `ActionStream`.
- One shell. Do not reintroduce a v1 / v2 split.
